course: dictionary
lesson: 2362
title: Cuddly and what it tells you
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A word can mean one thing and also suggest something more. «Cuddly» means soft, warm and nice to hug. A cuddly teddy is a toy you want to squeeze at bedtime.
explain: Look at the words around it. If a character in a story is cuddly, the author wants you to picture someone friendly and gentle. Ask yourself: what would this look like, feel like, or how would it make someone want to act?
explain: Be careful, though. «Skippy, Roo from Winnie the Pooh and cartoon boxers in gloves make kangaroos look like cuddly toys, but a real male's kick is rough.» Cuddly describes how something looks or seems, so a wild animal can look cuddly and still be dangerous.
fact: Cuddly means soft, warm and nice to hug.
fact: A cuddly person or animal is friendly and likes to be hugged, or is a little plump in a pleasant way.
fact: Cuddly is an adjective. Its other forms are cuddlier and cuddliest.
fact: Phrases you may see are cuddly toy, cuddly teddy and cuddly animal.
fact: «Kotyku!» is also a cuddly word for a person, like «darling», so cuddly can be used for people too.
exercise: Mum says, «Bring your cuddly teddy to bed.» What is a cuddly teddy? | A loud drum | A fast racing car | *A soft, warm toy that is nice to hug | A hard metal robot
exercise: «Puppies and kittens look cuddly, so the children wanted to hold them.» What does cuddly suggest here? | Dirty and wet | *Soft, warm and nice to hug | Angry and noisy | Very tall and thin
exercise: Ella reads that a bear looks cuddly in a picture. What should she remember? | A bear is only a kind of toy | Cuddly means very fast | Bears are always friendly | *Looks can be cuddly, but a wild bear can still be dangerous
test: Which word means soft, warm and nice to hug? | Treacherous | Curt | Barely | *Cuddly
test: A puppy is cuddly and a kitten is cuddlier. What is the most cuddly of all? | cuddlying | *cuddliest | cuddlest | cuddlyest
exam: You see a bear that looks cuddly in a picture. What should you do if you meet a real one? | Feed it from your hand | Call it a cuddly toy | Hug it tightly | *Keep a safe distance
